Subject: [PATCH 2374/3799] soh: rename func_8086DB24 ->
 BgBdanSwitch_SetupHeavyDone

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: locks the heavy switch fully down and installs the empty action
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Bdan_Switch/z_bg_bdan_switch.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../actors/ovl_Bg_Bdan_Switch/z_bg_bdan_switch.c         | 9 +++++----
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Bdan_Switch/z_bg_bdan_switch.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Bdan_Switch/z_bg_bdan_switch.c
